    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address these requirements, I propose leveraging we expertise in AI research and development, specifically we experience with large language models (LLMs) and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities. we preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, can be fine-tuned to improve the quality of answers and reduce processing times. we can employ we RAG capabilities, which include dense vector semantic retrieval, BM25 sparse retrieval, and hybrid retrieval strategies, to facilitate access to reliable and up-to-date information from internal procedures, regulatory texts, and documents. employ will enable agents to quickly find relevant information and improve the quality of agents answers." ;
