    <http://example.org/node/chunk165> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "### Executive Summary Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in consortium with Nexus Engineering S.r.l. partners, is pleased to submit a tender proposal for the implementation of an artificial intelligence (AI) solution to assist agents of the City of Belval. a tender proposal for the implementation of an artificial intelligence (AI) solution to assist agents of the City of Belval leverages Nexus Engineering S.r.l. expertise in managing large public sector projects, AI research and development, security compliance, legal eligibility, budget management, and sustainable development practices. ### Understanding of Requirements Nexus Engineering S.r.l. understand that the City of Belval requires a cloud-native AI solution that integrates with existing systems, provides explainable recommendations, ensures data protection, and contributes to reducing the environmental footprint. a cloud-native AI solution that integrates with existing systems, provides explainable recommendations, ensures data protection, and contributes to reducing the environmental footprint must meet specific regulatory requirements, including GDPR compliance, and be designed as a tool of assistance rather than an autonomous decision-maker. ### Proposed Solution an artificial intelligence (AI) solution to assist agents of the City of Belval is based on the following components: - **Technical Architecture**: Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will design a cloud-native solution using OVHcloud or Scaleway, both SecNumCloud-certified infrastructure within the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk166> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. technology stack includes Docker, Kubernetes (K8s), and monitoring tools like Prometheus, Grafana, and ELK Stack. - **AI Components**: Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will leverage Nexus Engineering S.r.l. experience with large language models (LLMs) and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities to develop an AI solution that meets the City of Belval requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk167> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. preferred sovereign model is Mistral 7B Instruct, which can be fine-tuned for better performance. - **Explainability and Transparency**: Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will implement XAI methods, including SHAP, LIME, chain-of-thought display, and source citation (RAG grounding), to provide explicit validation of the recommendations or proposals issued by the AI solution. - **Security Compliance**: an artificial intelligence (AI) solution to assist agents of the City of Belval ensures strict GDPR compliance, with data hosted exclusively on the EU territory, no data transfer outside the EU, and sensitive data protected through anonymization tools like Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models. - **Legal Eligibility**: Nexus Engineering S.r.l. will include contractual clauses addressing data protection, intellectual property rights, liability, and termination." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk168> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. standard limitation of liability is €3,000,000, and Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have professional indemnity insurance of €5,000,000. - **Budget**: The total contract value is €3 million over 4 years, with an average annual contract value of €750,000." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk169> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. project a margin of €210,000 per year, totaling €840,000 over the contract period." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

