        ex:hasText "The generated contents will have to be adapted to the administrative context and compliant with the requirements of quality expected. 3.3 Assistance with the instruction of files The expected solution will have to be in measure to assist the agents in the analysis and the processing of files, by: proposing relevant information, recalling the applicable rules, suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, our have experience with cloud providers such as OVHcloud, Scaleway, and Outscale (SecNumCloud), which are within the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This aligns with the client's requirement for hosting on SecNumCloud-certified infrastructure within the EU. our also have experience with API integration, including API gateways like Kong and Apigee, and support REST, GraphQL, and SOAP (legacy) standards. our experience with ERP/CRM connectors includes SAP, Salesforce, Oracle, and others, which may be relevant to integrating with the client's existing systems, such as civil-status and town-planning software, EDM, and user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our company context does not provide specific information on response times or availability percentages that our can guarantee. our do have experience with containerisation using Docker and Kubernetes (K8s), and monitoring tools like Prometheus, Grafana, and ELK stack, which can help in designing a scalable and maintainable solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure technical feasibility, I propose designing a cloud-native solution using our experienced cloud providers, leveraging our API integration capabilities, and utilizing containerization and monitoring tools." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our cannot confirm if our current technology stack can meet the specific response time and availability requirements without further analysis and testing." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, while our have experience with SecNumCloud deployments and can likely meet the requirement for no dependency on non-European suppliers, our should carefully review our current technology stack and partnerships to ensure compliance with the requirement for no dependency on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message6> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance (EU-only hosting, no data transfer outside EU, encryption of sensitive data)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message8> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "All AI recommendations must be explainable post-hoc, and no automated decision is allowed without explicit agent validation." ;
